    {
      "path": "runtimes/codex/app-server-client.ts",
      "sourcePath": "packages/oar/src/runtimes/codex/app-server-client.ts",
      "upstreamSha256": "6cfb2582a9beb597e5621e299a0463cdb234c808fab03f6874a509852dd62956",
      "vendoredSha256": "bbbcc35e5dec4e80b5506240021a1671b2ce95c5e83a6da5c04e7d322999a59e",
      "delta": "Caller-owned process: the injected LineProcess spawn receives exactly the explicit filtered env, cwd and launch arguments; no ambient env merge, home-initialization queue, executable manager, resources reader or killTree option. Bounded RPCs: 30000ms default and per-request deadlines (RpcTimeoutError), maxHeld=256 and maxPending=128 count budgets whose overflow fails and kills, timers cleared on reply, timeout, write failure, exit and kill. Server requests: numeric and string ids preserved; result and error replies go through the acknowledged stdin write. Terminal state: sticky terminal error with the bounded, redacted exitError of the BYOK transport; settlement-consumer errors reject already-dequeued waiters and never escape a timer."
    },
