    {
      "path": "runtimes/codex/rpc-control.ts",
      "sourcePath": "packages/oar/src/runtimes/codex/rpc-control.ts",
      "upstreamSha256": "89a001c616461df6b8c24c1d2201c3036b276aaf53fa8fc47fa90a18213778c1",
      "vendoredSha256": "f3388431b61fb16403c5a601b2b26c2c583a33f6b79d761e5e4d5688698bc054",
      "delta": "Bounded controls: every control RPC has a deadline (timeoutMs, default 30000ms), and an RpcTimeoutError is always one rejected response with code error, independent of the plan error mapper. Synchronous response capture through the client request callback instead of a second deferred waiter, so a failed kernel append or budget overflow rejects the control and never strands a waiter; a failed fallback takeover record rejects the control and never escapes the fallback timer."
    },
    {
      "path": "runtimes/codex/session.ts",
      "sourcePath": "packages/oar/src/runtimes/codex/session.ts",
      "upstreamSha256": "b07c31ed744abe598c6121c3ad471f830014a7a08471a14941da7c327ff875a0",
      "vendoredSha256": "4e267c35a925afc71503c82c1ca2ab5957e9c9b8caefb8dde48cb596b14480f5",
      "delta": "Raw adapter for the SDK: injected spawn and a required explicit filtered env; caller-selected sandboxMode (danger-full-access default, inherit passes no override) instead of ambient OAR_CODEX_SANDBOX; returns AdapterSession without sealSession/withSessionCredentials/observe, building one sessionCredentialRedactor per open as the kernel redact hook and for errors from the open path and every control. Native-first recording: each notification is retained as a body.origin=\"byok-native\" frame before the fold; a fold failure kills the process visibly. Server requests: caller-owned bounded native interaction lifecycle when configured, else synchronous decline/-32601 rejection under a 1000ms dispatch deadline; on-request approval policy is verified in the open reply. Owned process lifetime: spawn/adoption settles before the first write, failed initialization kills, the abort-fallback kill and deadline timers never throw. Codex steer is a required member."
    },
